{"unit_id":"tag:042E:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的一些性质：我们（尚）不能证明它们在fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）中关于基底是局部的，但它们在fppf拓扑（topology）中关于基底是局部的。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射所属对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本节研究对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑","context":"局部性所用拓扑；待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"fppf拓扑；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
