{"unit_id":"tag:042F:proof","translation":"局部分离的（locally separated）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）是局部分离的（locally separated），见《代数空间上的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>。因此得到定义<REF_0002>中的正向蕴含。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n令<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）。令<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。假设每个基变换（base change）<MATH_0005>都是局部分离的（locally separated）。这意味着每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0006>都是浸入（immersion）。fppf覆盖（fppf covering）的基变换（base change）是fppf覆盖（fppf covering），见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0003>，因此<MATH_0007>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的fppf覆盖（fppf covering）。此外，每个<MATH_0008>都是态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>的基变换（base change）。因此，由引理<REF_0004>可知，<MATH_0010>是浸入（immersion），即<MATH_0011>是局部分离的（locally separated）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"代数空间上的拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入"},{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"locally separated","target_term":"局部分离的","context":"态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"拉回操作；待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"代数空间上的态射","context":"章名中的术语；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"下降的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf覆盖","context":"下降覆盖；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"对角态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"immersion","target_term":"浸入","context":"对角态射性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"代数空间上的拓扑","context":"章名中的术语；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
